const char *of_rune_desc_cn[9]={"调整投掷力度后抛出圆弹，观察落地滚动，在岩石附近遥控引爆。","方炸弹停在落点，放到移动平台上可随平台运送，在高处岩石旁遥控引爆。","抓住金属铁板，搬到断口上方，让两端搭稳桥台形成通路。","让物体短暂静止。冻结期间连续击打可积蓄势能，解除时一次释放。","在水面升起冰柱，可作为踏脚石或顶起闸门。最多同时存在三根。","平移与缩放取景，避开遮挡后拍摄识别目标。本轮仅临时预览，相册后续讨论。","英杰所赠的希卡科技摩托车，可在平原与坡地高速穿行。","读取 amiibo，召唤材料、装备与宝藏。每日每只限用一次。","探测附近未被发现的神庙。靠近目标时，感应器以信号强弱提示接近方向。"};
const char *of_rune_desc_en[9]={"Adjust the throw, watch the bomb roll down the slope, then detonate near the rocks.","Stays where placed. Ride a moving platform to detonate beside the raised rocks.","Grab the metal slab and bridge the gap, resting both ends securely on the banks.","Freezes objects in time. Strike while frozen to store energy, released all at once on unfreeze.","Raises ice pillars from water — stepstones or gate lifts. Up to three at once.","Pan and zoom to photograph unobstructed subjects. Temporary preview only; album work is deferred.","A Sheikah motorcycle gifted by the Champions — swift travel across plains and slopes.","Scan amiibo to summon materials, gear and treasure. Once per figure per day.","Detects undiscovered shrines nearby. Signals strengthen as you move toward the target."};
